# Rocksalt NaCl, conventional cubic cell, a = 5.64 angstrom.
# Minimal hand-written CIF for the vibe-qc external-structures example:
# the four F-centring operations expand the two symmetry-unique sites
# to the eight atoms of the conventional cell.
data_NaCl
_chemical_formula_sum            'Na Cl'
_cell_length_a                   5.64
_cell_length_b                   5.64
_cell_length_c                   5.64
_cell_angle_alpha                90
_cell_angle_beta                 90
_cell_angle_gamma                90
_space_group_name_H-M_alt        'F m -3 m'
_space_group_IT_number           225
loop_
_space_group_symop_operation_xyz
'x, y, z'
'x, y+1/2, z+1/2'
'x+1/2, y, z+1/2'
'x+1/2, y+1/2, z'
loop_
_atom_site_label
_atom_site_type_symbol
_atom_site_fract_x
_atom_site_fract_y
_atom_site_fract_z
Na1 Na 0.0 0.0 0.0
Cl1 Cl 0.5 0.5 0.5
